<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Landstar System raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Landstar System raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst James Valentine upgraded Landstar System Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a research report, said company's restructuring plan is &quot;proceeding smoothly, reducing risk and clearing the way for strong free cash flow for the foreseeable future.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-5/16 to 23-3/4.</p>
</text>
